  "title": "Cast Iron Skillet Sweet and Sour Pork Chops",
  "description": "Bone-in pork chops are seared and simmered in an Asian-inspired sweet and sour sauce in a cast iron skillet for this easy weeknight dish.",
  "authors": [
    "BirgitJ"
  ],
